  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROMOTE DECENT WORK, RIGHTS AND DIGNITY FOR DOSMESTIC WORKERS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x2018;Promote Decent Work, Rights and Dignity for Domestic Workers&#x2019; project, implemented with Community of Volunteers for the World, aims to improve the quality of life for local and migrant Domestic Workers. It seeks to; increase the voice of Civil Society Organisations representing Domestic Workers in policy dialogue; strengthen their capacity to secure better working conditions; and empower local and migrant Domestic Workers by increasing their professional and negotiation capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
